  "research": {
    "note": "Research at IIT (ISM) leans on its earth-science base: mining, petroleum and applied geology labs work alongside newer computing and engineering groups, and a 2017 survey by an institute team estimated a roughly Rs 36,000 crore manganese ore deposit. PhD scholars are enrolled across regular, externally-funded and part-time tracks year round.",
